          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acquisiamo maggiore familiarità con l'uso delle funzioni freccia. Per farlo, vedremo come usare i parametri all'interno delle funzioni freccia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>discount</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Acquisiamo maggiore familiarità con l'uso delle funzioni freccia. Per farlo, vedremo come usare i parametri all'interno delle funzioni freccia.</p><p>Usa lo sconto passato a <code>getPrice</code> in modo che uno sconto del 25% produca il risultato <code>375</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0.5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"250\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getPrice</code>, seguito da <code>discount</code> e infine <code>0.25</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter",
            "id": 103009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri nelle funzioni freccia sono simili ai parametri nelle funzioni normali. Scrivi una funzione freccia che utilizzi <code>total</code> come parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>total</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri nelle funzioni freccia sono simili ai parametri nelle funzioni normali.</p><p>Completa la funzione in modo che <code>getPrice(500)</code> applichi lo sconto del 10% e visualizzi <code>450</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getPrice</code>, seguito da <code>total</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>return</code> e infine <code>getPrice</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter II",
            "id": 103324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nelle funzioni freccia, non dobbiamo aggiungere le parentesi se abbiamo un solo parametro. Scrivi il parametro <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>total</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value",
            "id": 103010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori dei parametri sono impostati su <code>undefined</code> per impostazione predefinita. Se una chiamata di funzione non passa un valore, la funzione utilizzerà <code>undefined</code> come valore.</p><p>Chiama la funzione <code>getPrice()</code> qui sotto per vedere che visualizza <code>NaN</code>, che significa che è un valore non definito.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getPrice</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori dei parametri sono impostati su <code>undefined</code> per impostazione predefinita. Se una chiamata di funzione non passa un valore, la funzione utilizzerà <code>undefined</code> come valore.</p><p>Usa <code>console.log</code> per mostrare il risultato della chiamata a <code>getPrice</code> senza un valore: <code>NaN</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(0)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>console.log</code> e infine <code>getPrice()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value II",
            "id": 103108,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per evitare valori undefined, specifichiamo il valore predefinito tra parentesi.</p><p>Imposta il valore predefinito del parametro all'interno delle parentesi su <code>total=200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per evitare valori undefined, imposta un valore predefinito tra parentesi con <code>=</code>, come <code>total = 200</code>.</p><p>Usa un totale predefinito di <code>200</code>, poi chiama la funzione senza argomenti per visualizzare <code>168</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(200)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>200</code> e infine <code>getPrice()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 103011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare più parametri, aggiungi il nuovo parametro tra le parentesi e separalo dal resto aggiungendo una virgola <code>,</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi un parametro predefinito aggiuntivo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>discount</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare più parametri, aggiungi il nuovo parametro tra le parentesi e separalo dal resto aggiungendo una virgola <code>,</code>.</p><p>Aggiungi lo sconto predefinito che fa visualizzare <code>194</code> quando la funzione viene chiamata senza argomenti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>discount</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>/</code> e infine <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Summary",
            "id": 103323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni freccia ci permettono di scrivere codice più compatto e conciso. Il modo in cui le scriviamo dipende dai parametri che usiamo e dalle dimensioni del blocco di codice.</p><p>Queste funzioni saranno essenziali più avanti, quando le useremo in codice più complesso, come React.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni freccia ci permettono di scrivere codice più compatto e conciso. Il modo in cui le scriviamo dipende dai parametri che usiamo e dalle dimensioni del blocco di codice.</p><p>Completa la funzione freccia e la chiamata che applicano uno sconto del 10% a <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getPrice</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>getPrice</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter",
            "id": 103683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va nel codice seguente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il parametro <code>movie</code> dovrebbe trovarsi dopo <code>=</code> e prima di <code>=&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il parametro <code>movie</code> deve venire prima delle parentesi <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il parametro <code>movie</code> dovrebbe trovarsi dopo <code>=</code> e prima di <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale coppia di modifiche trasforma il codice mostrato in una funzione che restituisce il titolo del film costruito?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Metti <code>movie</code> tra <code>=</code> e <code>=&gt;</code>, poi restituisci la stringa costruita.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sposta <code>getTitle</code> dopo <code>=&gt;</code>, poi visualizza la stringa all'interno della funzione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sposta <code>movie</code> dopo il corpo della funzione, poi rimuovi le parentesi graffe.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Metti <code>movie</code> tra <code>=</code> e <code>=&gt;</code>, poi restituisci la stringa costruita.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter II",
            "id": 103684,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo abbreviare il codice seguente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code> attorno a <code>number</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovendo le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code> attorno a <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale modifica mantiene valido <code>getDouble(4)</code> e continua a produrre <code>8</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code> attorno a <code>number</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovere <code>=&gt;</code> prima di <code>number * 2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rimuovere <code>number</code> e lasciare le parentesi vuote <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Rimuovendo le parentesi <code>()</code> attorno a <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter III",
            "id": 103850,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = number,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" multiplier =&gt; number * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mancano le parentesi intorno ai due parametri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo usare più parametri con le funzioni freccia</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mancano le parentesi intorno ai due parametri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale coppia di correzioni permette a questa funzione di moltiplicare <code>4</code> per un moltiplicatore fornito?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = number,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" multiplier =&gt; number * multiplier;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Racchiudi entrambi i parametri tra parentesi e passa un moltiplicatore nella chiamata.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sposta entrambi i parametri dopo la freccia e rimuovi la virgola.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mantieni l'elenco dei parametri come mostrato e sostituisci la moltiplicazione con l'addizione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Racchiudi entrambi i parametri tra parentesi e passa un moltiplicatore nella chiamata.</p></body></html>"
          },
