          {
            "title": "Example: One parameter",
            "id": 103691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la funzione freccia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>discount</code> e infine <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un singolo parametro di una funzione freccia non richiede parentesi. Completa la funzione in modo che uno sconto di <code>10</code> faccia visualizzare <code>90</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - discount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getPrice</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>discount</code> e infine <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Default parameter value",
            "id": 103693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta il valore predefinito del parametro su <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>number</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta il valore predefinito del parametro su <code>0</code>. La chiamata fornisce <code>5</code>, quindi il risultato deve essere ancora <code>25</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getSquare = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getSquare(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getSquare()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>getSquare</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>0</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple parameters",
            "id": 103695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un secondo parametro, <code>width</code>, alla funzione freccia e imposta il suo valore predefinito su <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getArea = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"length, width = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" length * width;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getArea(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"15\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>width = 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
